羊羔的皮，所以并不十分厚重，才使得莫忆儿并没有很热的感觉，否则大夏天穿皮衣，非要悟出痱子不成。换完之后，两个人往山洞方向走去，天色已经暗黑，接近火堆，桑贞才看清楚穿上兽皮衣裙的莫忆儿。“哇，没想到羊皮裙这么好看！”莫忆儿浅浅的笑了，这自然是好看的，雪白雪白的，还有短短的白色绒毛，看起来可爱至极。偏偏正适合她这种发育不太好的小胸少女！桑贞的话引来众人的目光，这一刻所有坎内部族的族人眼中都盛满了赞美，幡戈脸上挂着大大的笑意，洁白的牙齿在火光之下反射出光辉，他走了过来，毫不吝啬的夸奖:“莫忆儿，你真可爱，就像是小白虎一样。”这样说是有根据的，偏巧莫忆儿笑着和族人打招呼的时候露出两颗可爱的小虎牙，再配上这一身毛绒绒的羊羔皮衣裙，简直是萌翻了。“呵呵，谢谢夸奖。”“莫忆儿，你这个……嗯，羊皮背心做的很奇怪，很好看，你是怎么想出来的？”首领楚炑回来之后，幡戈就卸掉了管理族人的重担，露出了他年少天真的一面，刚刚通过楚炑，莫忆儿已经知道了，幡戈比楚炑还要小两个石头的年纪，可以说16岁的幡戈还是个未成年，不过，不得不说原始人长得还真是成熟啊。“肯定是神灵都穿成这样！”经过了几天的相处，桑贞很喜欢待在莫忆儿身边，这时候幡戈来问莫忆儿，活泼的她跳出来回答幡戈。“什么神灵？你们在说什么？”刚刚消停了一小会而的泰梨莎忍不住又插嘴。“没什么神灵，他们在开玩笑。”显然，楚炑并不想让泰梨莎知道太多部族的事情。“好了，都吃晚饭吧！”楚炑一声令下，已经开始有女人分食物了。依旧是烤肉，莫忆儿觉得自己吃肉吃的上火了，看着面前黑糊糊的烤肉，嘴巴里面就发疼。“莫忆儿，你怎么不吃呢？今天放了不少的盐巴，很好吃的！”幡戈在莫忆儿身边坐下，大嚼着手中的烤肉。莫忆儿只好撕下小小的一块放进嘴里，咸味是重了一些，看来这次首领楚炑换回了不少的盐巴。不过，再多的盐巴，也只是放在肉上面，她真的很想吃点蔬菜啊。“幡戈，明天我可以走远一点吗?我想找点其他东西来吃，整天吃肉我都上火了！”“上火？什么是上火？”幡戈下意识的去看不远处的火堆。“就是嘴巴里面都起泡，溃疡，很疼！”这句话，幡戈听懂了一半，他们也有时候会这样，但这和火有什么关系？“过几天就好了，不用担心，你要出去找什么东西来吃？我帮你带回来！”莫忆儿闻言有些气恼：“你能不能不这样把我关在山洞周围，我又不是不回来。你也看到了，我不会打猎，不回来会饿死的。我只是出去走走！”“让她去吧，带上石刀和小剌剌一起。”楚炑听到了他们的对话，下达了这样的指示，小剌剌十几岁的年纪，具体没人记得是他生活了多少个春天。他虽然小，但身体很灵敏，有时候会和族人们一起去打猎，在原始部族里面，小剌剌已经算不上是个孩子了。让小剌剌保护莫忆儿在山洞附近走动，大家还是都放心的。“太好了，我终于可以走远一点了。”这个指示对于莫忆儿来说无疑是个特赦令，让她很是高兴。可是，她高兴了，自然有人不会高兴。“她去做什么？我也要去！”泰梨莎很是任性的说着，真是个让人头疼的女人，除了胸部大一点，简直没有任何的优点。“你不怕遇到野兽吗？被野兽吃了可别怪我们坎内部落的人没好好保护你！”幡戈讽刺着泰梨莎，这个时候的他凸显了小孩子的性格，整个人像是刺毛的小兽。“哼，那让楚炑保护我好了，我要和楚炑在一起。”“我要去打猎，没时间！”楚炑冷淡的拒绝，让泰梨莎眼中满是失望。“那我陪你去打猎好了！”“打猎？哼，野兽可不会因为你是软弱的女人就对你收起獠牙和利爪！”幡戈和楚炑两兄弟一唱一和的讽刺着泰梨莎。泰梨莎也似乎想起了猛兽的獠牙和利爪，害怕的不再坚持：“那就让我和这个女人去转转，我可不想整日待在山洞里面。”“泰梨莎，你还是早点回去吧，海边适合你，你可以和你们海姆部落的男人们一起捕鱼、晒盐！”楚炑声音微微柔和的劝说，只要泰梨莎肯离开，他会对她好好商量的。“我不要，怀上你的孩子之前，我是不会离开坎内部落的！”泰梨莎固执的要命，看着楚炑的眼神发光，就像是想要随时把他扑到一样。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/sifuzhengchong-mengguaifujunyangchengji/9.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 9 Cute Sheep Costume \"Humph!\" Terisa snorted, looking at Bange's fierce look, she didn't dare to say anything. Sang Zhen once again urged Mo Yi'er to try her new animal skin skirt, but Mo Yi'er didn't move. She had to take off her grass skirt first after putting on the sheepskin skirt. Wouldn't that mean she was being seen naked? The people here didn't have the consciousness to avoid it, so they had to say: \"Let's try it together after I finish sewing the vest!\" \"Okay, I'll help you!\" With Sang Zhen's help, the sheepskin vest was finished before dinner. Sang Zhen once again asked Mo Yi'er to try on a new animal skin dress. Mo Yi'er couldn't refuse, but she didn't want to be seen naked, so she took Sang Zhen to a big tree outside the cave to change clothes. Sang Zhen covered her mouth and giggled, making Mo Yi'er's cheeks turn red: \"Sang Zhen, don't laugh!\" \"Mo Yi'er, you are so shy. Why are you hiding here when you are just changing clothes?\" Mo Yi'er had already put the wet panty on her butt. Pulling up her sheepskin skirt, she replied: \"I don't want to be seen in public. We don't let people see our private parts so casually.\" \"Private parts?\" \"Well, it's the breasts and here!\" Mo Yi'er pointed to her two small peaches, and then pointed below. \"Oh! The gods are so shy!\" Of course, Sang Zhen regarded the humans who were thousands of years in the future where Mo Yi'er lived as gods. Mo Yi'er didn't explain, but just put on the sheepskin vest. Because it was lamb's skin, it was not very thick, so Mo Yi'er did not feel very hot. Otherwise, wearing leather clothes in the summer would have caused prickly heat. After changing, the two people walked towards the cave. It was already dark. As they approached the fire, Sang Zhen could clearly see Mo Yi'er who was wearing an animal skin dress. \"Wow, I didn't expect the sheepskin skirt to be so good-looking!\" Mo Yi'er smiled lightly. It is naturally good-looking. It is snow-white and has short white fluff. It looks extremely cute. It just suits a girl like her with small breasts that is not well developed! Sang Zhen's words attracted everyone's attention. At this moment, the eyes of all the Kannei clan members were filled with praise. Bange had a big smile on his face, and his white teeth reflected the light under the firelight. He walked over and praised without hesitation: \"Mo Yi'er, you're so cute, just like a little white tiger.\" This statement is well-founded. It happened that Mo Yi'er showed two cute little tiger teeth when she smiled and greeted her tribe members. Coupled with this plush lambskin dress, she looked so cute. \"Haha, thank you for the compliment.\" \"Mo Yi'er, you... well, the sheepskin vest is very strange and beautiful. How did you come up with it?\" After the leader Chu Yi came back, Ban Ge relieved the burden of managing the tribe and revealed his youth. As for the innocent side of young people, Mo Yi'er had just passed Chu Yi and already knew that Ban Ge was two stones younger than Chu Yi. It could be said that the 16-year-old Ban Ge was still a minor. However, it had to be said that the primitive man looked really mature. \"It must be the gods dressed like this!\" After a few days of getting along, Sang Zhen liked being by Mo Yi'er's side. At this time, Ban Ge came to ask Mo Yi'er, and she jumped out to answer Ban Ge lively. \"What god? What are you talking about?\" Teresa, who had just been silent for a while, couldn't help but interrupt again. \"There are no gods, they are joking.\" Obviously, Chu Yi didn't want Talisa to know too much about the tribe. \"Okay, let's all have dinner!\" Chu Yi gave the order, and women were already sharing the food. It was still barbecue. Mo Yi'er felt that she was getting angry from eating meat. Looking at the dark barbecue in front of her, her mouth hurt. \"Mo Yi'er, why don't you eat it? I put a lot of salt in it today, it's delicious!\" Ban Ge sat down next to Mo Yi'er and munched on the barbecue in his hand. Mo Yi'er had no choice but to tear off a small piece and put it in her mouth. The salty taste was a bit stronger. It seemed that the leader Chu Yi had gained a lot of salt this time. However, no matter how much salt is put on the meat, she really wants to eat some vegetables. \"Bange, can I go farther tomorrow? I want to find something else to eat. I'm getting angry after eating meat all day!\" \"Getting angry? What is getting angry?\" Bange subconsciously looked at the fire not far away. \"It's just blisters and ulcers in the mouth. It hurts!\" Bange understood half of this sentence. They also do this sometimes, but what does this have to do with fire? \"It'll be fine in a few days. Don't worry. Are you going out to find something to eat? I'll bring it back for you!\" Mo Yi'er was a little angry when she heard this: \"Can you stop locking me up around the cave like this? It's not like I won't come back. You've seen it too, I can't hunt, no. I will starve to death when I come back. \"Let her go, bring Shi Dao with Xiao La La.\" Chu Yi heard their conversation and gave this instruction. No one remembers how many springs Xiao La La had lived. Although he is small, his body is very agile, and he sometimes goes hunting with his tribe. Among the primitive tribes, Xiao Lala is no longer considered a child. Let Xiao Lala protect Mo Yi'er as she walks around the cave, and everyone feels relieved. \"Great, I can finally go further.\" This instruction was undoubtedly an amnesty order for Mo Yi'er, which made her very happy. However, if she is happy, naturally some people will not be happy. \"What is she going to do? I'm going to go too!\" Teresa said very willfully. She is really a troublesome woman. Apart from her bigger breasts, she has no advantages. \"Aren't you afraid of encountering wild beasts? If you are eaten by wild beasts, don't blame us, the people of the Kannai tribe, for not protecting you properly!\" Ban Ge sarcastically said to Teresa. At this time, he highlighted the character of a child, and his whole figure looked like a little beast with thorns. \"Hmph, then let Chu Yi protect me. I want to be with Chu Yi.\" \"I have to go hunting, I don't have time!", "title_en": "Chapter 9"}